{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"fields":{"description":"## Context\nThis workstream has 23 closed remediation leaves across interface, script, integration, external, and end-to-end tests. The retired audit contributed 232 distinct historical source tickets. Git-history reconciliation at origin/main@e539e4a65d3e7451ca3dbc4b754ba4a2370cc3cc classifies 214 source paths still present, 17 deleted paths, and 1 old seam path copied into a current file now owned by tense-demonic-bat under another story. The live child Scope and file-impact manifests cover 222 distinct present paths: 214 with a current retired-source mapping and 8 added without one. This story makes no repository edits.\n\n## Plan\n- Keep each retired source's immutable historical path and its single net-active superseding leaf. Record its current disposition and Git evidence in the migration TSV; a deleted source does not create a fictitious current execution path.\n- Derive the current execution TSV from the 23 live closed children. Every row names a present path in that leaf's Scope and file_impact, and distinguishes a current source mapping from an added path.\n- Migration TSV (232 rows): `historical_path<TAB>historical_replacement_leaf<TAB>source_ticket_id<TAB>source_ticket_alias<TAB>disposition<TAB>verified_current_path<TAB>current_action_leaf<TAB>git_evidence`.\n- Execution TSV (222 rows): `path<TAB>replacement_leaf<TAB>source_ticket_alias<TAB>source_ticket_id<TAB>source_count<TAB>live_scope_evidence<TAB>live_file_impact<TAB>leaf_status<TAB>disposition<TAB>pinned_main`.\n- Store the exact sorted TSVs in a dedicated session_log linked relates_to this story. Record row counts and SHA-256 values in the completion comment. Cite each leaf's merged change, verification result, and nonauthor receipt in that log.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] All 23 child leaves are closed.\n- [ ] The migration TSV has 232 rows with 232 distinct historical paths and 232 distinct retired source IDs, each linked to exactly 1 historical replacement leaf.\n- [ ] The migration dispositions total 214 same-path current, 17 deleted, and 1 copied current target with its separate action leaf; every nonpresent path has Git history evidence.\n- [ ] No deleted historical source is counted as a current execution path.\n- [ ] The execution TSV has 222 rows with 222 distinct current paths, all present at the pinned main tree and owned by the named closed leaf's live Scope and file_impact.\n- [ ] Exactly 214 execution rows have source_count=1 and exactly 8 have source_count=0.\n- [ ] Every migrated Scope constraint and consumer contract has a nonauthor semantic-preservation=PASS receipt with immutable citations.\n- [ ] Every edited prose block has a nonauthor bloat-removal=PASS receipt.\n- [ ] Every recorded leaf verification command exits 0 at its cited commit.\n- [ ] The linked story log records each leaf's merged commit, command results, and nonauthor review receipt or reviewer-log ID.\n- [ ] The completion comment cites the linked story log and both exact TSV row counts and SHA-256 values.\n\n## Completion boundary\nClose this story only after the historical migration and current execution inventories pass these checks. The original 242-path current inventory mixed deleted historical paths with present code; Git history and live Scope give the corrected count above."}},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"EDIT","timestamp":1792811022203898559,"uuid":"ae72b9a9-a361-48f4-ae67-2a64102e0486"}